Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fade(500,500)\blur3}本字幕由悠哈璃羽字幕社製作，僅用於日語交流使用\N請勿私自二次上傳及用作商業用途
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fade(500,500)\blur3}翻譯:阿恁&雪音  校對:狗糧山  時軸:懶鬼後裔樰七  後期:冷麵珺  壓製:zoe  海報:狗糧山
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.73,0:00:03.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,至今為止大家的職位都是臨時分配的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:07.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,之後終於要決定大家的最終分配去向了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:09.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.69,0:00:12.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要和冬月小姐  分開了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:25.83,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,900)\blur5\pos(1077.333,759.333)}第3話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:25.83,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fade(800,900)\pos(1246.666,839.999)}初次約飯與私密照片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:31.42,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}冷たい指先感じられる距離感
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:31.42,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}能感受到指尖冰涼的距離感
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.91,0:00:37.50,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}もどかしくて少し切ない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.91,0:00:37.50,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}令人急不可待  又有些許愁緒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:43.51,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}ひとつずつ灯る街灯に呼応して
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:43.51,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}與一盞盞點亮的路燈遙相呼應
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:49.36,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}募っていく気持ちに気付いた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:49.36,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}覺察到心中一點點積攢的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.48,0:00:57.01,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,照れ隠してもクールぶっても {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.48,0:00:57.01,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,不管是遮羞  抑或是裝酷 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.29,0:00:59.90,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,見透かされそう {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.29,0:00:59.90,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,都像會被看透似的 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:03.06,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,やさしく {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:03.06,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,溫柔地 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.06,0:01:05.31,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Freeze for a minute {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.06,0:01:05.31,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,凍結一分鐘 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.40,0:01:08.32,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,心ごと {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.40,0:01:08.32,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,全心全意 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.48,0:01:14.44,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,I miss you 言わせたくて {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.48,0:01:14.44,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,想讓你說  我想你 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.67,0:01:17.60,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Let me love you honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.67,0:01:17.60,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,讓我愛你  honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.79,0:01:20.63,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,言えない for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.79,0:01:20.63,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,說不出口  for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.88,0:01:28.62,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,いつか言葉にできたら {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.88,0:01:28.62,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,假如有朝一日能說出口 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.21,0:01:50.71,Koori-pictur5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(922,416)}崗位分配通知
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.16,0:01:53.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,明天起就是正式分配部門了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.95,0:02:05.16,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,如果和冬月小姐分到不同的部門怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:14.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喵梅洛同學  拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.29,0:02:20.77,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,求求了  保佑我和冬月小姐分配到同一個部門
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.59,0:02:30.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喵梅洛？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.47,0:02:36.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.53,0:02:38.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我手機呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.57,0:02:53.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,還是第一次與他人這麼親近
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.79,0:02:59.82,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,如果分到同一個部門就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.41,0:03:11.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:16.21,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,本年度新員工已結束研修培訓，現已分配好部門，名單詳情通知如下。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:18.30,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,下記
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:18.30,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,狐森
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.31,0:03:28.81,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.05,0:03:29.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.09,0:03:46.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,有了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.97,0:03:49.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.38,0:03:51.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和冬月小姐一個部門
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.31,0:04:02.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.21,0:04:04.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,大家都在同一個部門
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:06.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,騙人的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.44,0:04:10.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:13.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這是我的座位
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.22,0:04:17.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,然後隔壁是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.07,0:04:20.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:30.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不僅在一個部門  連座位也挨在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.81,0:04:34.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我們又是鄰座呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.52,0:04:37.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,請多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.46,0:04:45.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這樣的鄰座安排實在是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:47.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.39,0:04:54.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.05,0:04:56.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,又在一起了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.12,0:05:00.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的  請多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.86,0:05:06.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不過  之前的成員全在一個部門  真是好巧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.65,0:05:10.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,與其說是巧合…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.91,0:05:12.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不如說是命中注定？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.57,0:05:15.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,命中  注定
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:18.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.28,0:05:25.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,命中注定嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:29.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和冬月小姐在一個部門也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.09,0:05:34.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,貓的鬍鬚好像可以作護身符呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.86,0:05:38.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,希望…冰室先生能好事常伴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.90,0:05:43.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,多虧了這個護身符啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.02,0:05:54.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喵梅洛大人  感謝您
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.25,0:06:00.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,在沖繩的時候  受了她很多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:04.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,研修旅行時  在我融化的時候也救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.27,0:06:07.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,總會關心我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.10,0:06:14.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我實在欠她太多人情了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.81,0:06:19.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,有沒有什麼方法能償還這些恩情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:34.74,Koori-picture6,,0,0,0,,表達謝意的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.11,0:06:34.74,Koori-picture6,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE292EA&}餐廳款待
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.86,0:06:36.77,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,就是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:43.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.66,0:06:46.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,看來你很喜歡吃油炸食品呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.70,0:06:49.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,因為我是妖狐的後裔嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:53.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐喜歡吃什麼呀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.77,0:06:55.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喜歡的食物嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.06,0:07:04.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我什麼都喜歡  從小就不挑食
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.75,0:07:07.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不挑食啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.85,0:07:06.24,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,誒  真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.99,0:07:10.67,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,我有家推薦的油炸店下次一起去吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.83,0:07:09.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,實在太讚了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.53,0:07:11.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.29,0:07:15.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我要邀請她去哪兒吃好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.74,0:07:20.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,行吧  直接問問看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.96,0:07:29.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.99,0:07:31.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:35.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,法國菜  意大利菜  日料  中餐  韓料
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:38.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,越南菜  泰國菜  墨西哥菜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.02,0:07:40.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,印度菜  尼泊爾菜  西班牙菜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:42.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你喜歡吃哪種
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.07,0:07:50.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我…都喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.93,0:07:53.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,都喜歡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.62,0:08:05.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不按喜歡什麼菜而是按餐廳裝修來選呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.35,0:08:08.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不對  比起這個  選公司附近的餐廳真的可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.74,0:08:11.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,糟了  又凍上了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.45,0:08:14.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.77,0:08:18.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊沒事  謝謝關心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.98,0:08:26.48,Koori-picture7,,0,0,0,,{\fs100\c&HDED177&}東京{\fs70\c&H3D5E68&}最佳餐廳前{\c&H1A00CA&\fs90}50
